# Provenance-critical files are hashed over their exact bytes
# (`serving/prompts.py: prompts_sha()`), so a line-ending conversion silently
# changes the hash without changing a character of content. A Windows editor
# rewrote data/prompts.json to CRLF once, which would have shipped a prompt
# file that did not correspond to the published records.
#
# Force LF for everything text, and treat the frozen data files as binary so
# nothing is tempted to normalise them at all.
* text=auto eol=lf
data/prompts.json           -text
data/mock_validity_gate.jsonl -text
results/*.jsonl             -text
